# The PDA profile's page titles (report 040): on a canvas under 600 px wide the shared page header draws its title at
# 18 px (the 32 px one cut "Date & Time", "Keyboard test", "Network Time" beside the narrowed status strip) and a
# breadcrumb title shows its last part only. Every title is checked whole (expect_text) and against the home grid's
# header (run.sh header):
#   Settings > Date & Time, its Set Manually section, System > On-screen keyboard (the longest title, about 186 px) and
#   the development page Keyboard test;
#   the list demo page with a path ("Net Toolbox", "Diagnosis") and with one string written as a breadcrumb
#   ("Net Toolbox > Diagnosis", as an app may pass it): both show "Diagnosis" only.
# Goldens at both PDA sizes.
title pda titles
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
# the portrait launcher without the writing zone (report 040, S2): kept as the regression of a portrait canvas
# without APPLAUNCH_PDA; the zone itself: the zone_* scenes (report 041)
env APPLAUNCH_PDA 0
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-10-10
wifi 70
bt on
ntp off
home
header home
launch Settings
# root: Up from Screen wraps to System, Up again is Date & Time
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
shot pda_title_datetime
header pda_title_datetime "Date & Time"
expect_text "Date & Time"
# Info, Network Time (a toggle row, off), Set Manually
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
shot pda_title_manual
header pda_title_manual "Set Manually"
expect_text "Set Manually"
key ESC
key ESC
# System (the last section, after Date & Time); from its end: Shutdown, Reboot, Keyboard test, On-screen keyboard
key DOWN
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 300
shot pda_title_osk_choice
header pda_title_osk_choice "On-screen keyboard"
expect_text "On-screen keyboard"
key ESC
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot pda_title_keyboard_test
header pda_title_keyboard_test "Keyboard test"
expect_text "Keyboard test"
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
listdemo comfortable 3
listtitle "Net Toolbox" Diagnosis
shot pda_title_crumb_path
header pda_title_crumb_path Diagnosis
expect_text Diagnosis
listtitle "Net Toolbox > Diagnosis"
shot pda_title_crumb_string
header pda_title_crumb_string Diagnosis
expect_text Diagnosis
